    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφώβολος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>javelin</i> or <i>spit with double point,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1133
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Adj., in neut. pl., <i>roasted on the spit,</i> of
			victims sacrificed in divination, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1006
			</span></i> (expl. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ σπλάγχνων
			μαντεῖαι</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1405.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
